OL,3,GNEWSACan employee ownership protect
OL,4,Aindependent brewers?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs many independent breweries continue
OL,7,Fto decline amid growing uncertainty in
OL,8,Fthe industry, one business believes it
OL,9,Fhas found a way to secure its future.
OL,11,FRebellion Brewery in Marlow, became
OL,12,Femployee-owned on Friday, meaning all
OL,13,Fprofits go back into the business and
OL,14,Femployees can receive tax-free bonuses
OL,15,Fand a stake in its success.
OL,17,FThe Society of Independent Brewers and
OL,18,FAssociates (SIBA) said more breweries
OL,19,Fare looking at the model as many now
OL,20,Fadopt a community-led approach, via
OL,21,Fdirect sales and tap rooms.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
